    "scope": "Four actually inspected2014/2017/2021 facade/court/aerial pictures plus standard viewer PMTiles/DEM. No bespoke surveys or redistributed photographs;current finish unverified.",
    "pictures": [
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Faisal_Masjid_front_view.jpg",
        "author": "King Eliot",
        "date": "2017-04-05",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "observed": "Inspected960×720 front/lawn picture:four tall narrow angular pencil minarets with flared feet,inset long vertical panels,small open collar below pyramidal tips. Tent hall has white folded sloping planes,deep triangular gable filled with repeated pale vertical fins/dark slit windows,sharp rim and high central multi-prong crest. Low flat colonnade extends sideways;lawns/people/trees remain host content."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Faisal_Mosque_Islamabad_exterior_view_of_main_hall_pic-02.jpg",
        "author": "Muhammad Rizwan Tarbela",
        "date": "2014-03-31",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-3.0",
        "observed": "Inspected960×720 low hall-entry picture:white triangular gable with tall narrow ribs and repeated small screen fields,low glass door row under broad projecting flat canopy with deep triangular underslung braces. Sharp roof-edge band and dark narrow seam along folded roof. Central angular crown has gold crescent;minarets have rectangular slit panels/open upper collar. Exact screen artwork/carving/calligraphy omitted."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Faisal_Mosque_External_Courtyard.jpg",
        "author": "ClicksByMohammadOmer",
        "date": "2014-09-06",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-3.0",
        "observed": "Inspected960×579 court picture:large flat pale canopy on four broad rectangular piers,upturned corner fins,open air underneath and low pale balustrade. Fine geometric soffit decoration is omitted. Flat open pergola/colonnade continues on both sides;small pointed opening beyond. Working east entrance pavilion is picture-estimated;photo does not establish an exact surveyed subplan."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aerial_View_of_Grand_Faisal_Mosque.jpg",
        "author": "Mhtoori",
        "date": "2021-07-31",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "observed": "Inspected960×640 aerial oblique:compact folded square tent hall with four corner pencil minarets and central crown,wide low entry awning,open colonnades along terrace edges. Large flat platform court has small square lightwell openings and an octagonal turquoise basin with star-like center and low surrounding rail;pool behind main hall. Lower two-story platform fascia/glazing under court. Adjacent lawns,trees/roads/hills remain separate host assets."
      }
    ]
  }
